                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Jesu achiaambira anafundzie, “Yeyesi amendzaye kukala mwanafundzi wangu ni lazima ariche njiraze mwenye, akale tayari kugaya kpwa kutsukula msalabawe, na anilunge. ",
          "type": "text",
