          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakuambirani kpweli kukala, phapha phana anjina ambao taandafwa hadi amuone Mutu Yela Mlunguni, aredza kpwenye ufalumewe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.28",
